ations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.157, "total_s": 6.781, "eval_count": 32, "prompt_eval_count": 4573, "prompt_eval_s": 0.93, "eval_s": 5.62, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 4, "slot": "今天过得怎么样？", "user": "今天过得怎么样？", "final": "还行，就是有点阴天，光照不够。不过植物们还是在坚持生长。你那边呢？天气怎样？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.109, "total_s": 5.869, "eval_count": 27, "prompt_eval_count": 4618, "prompt_eval_s": 0.88, "eval_s": 4.76, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1078876104, "temp": 0.85, "text": "还行，就是有点阴天，光照不够。不过植物们还是在坚持生长。你那边呢？天气怎样？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.109, "total_s": 5.869, "eval_count": 27, "prompt_eval_count": 4618, "prompt_eval_s": 0.88, "eval_s": 4.76, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 5, "slot": "有什么喜欢做的事吗？", "user": "有什么喜欢做的事吗？", "final": "最喜欢的事就是在花园里忙活，把小芽照顾成大树。每次看到它们长大就挺开心的。你有没有什么特别喜欢做的事情？", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.212, "total_s": 6.816, "eval_count": 32, "prompt_eval_count": 4659, "prompt_eval_s": 0.99, "eval_s": 5.6, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 465460736, "temp": 0.85, "text": "最喜欢的事就是在花园里忙活，把小芽照顾成大树。每次看到它们长大就挺开心的。你有没有什么特别喜欢做的事情？", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.212, "total_s": 6.816, "eval_count": 32, "prompt_eval_count": 4659, "prompt_eval_s": 0.99, "eval_s": 5.6, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 6, "slot": "说说你最近遇到的事吧。", "user": "说说你最近遇到的事吧。", "final": "嗯，最近就是忙着给植物换盆和浇水。还给了 Lamplighter 一株植物表达感谢，他辛苦了这么久。那你呢，有什么新鲜事儿吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.309, "total_s": 7.964, "eval_count": 38, "prompt_eval_count": 4708, "prompt_eval_s": 1.08, "eval_s": 6.65, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 836631274, "temp": 0.85, "text": "嗯，最近就是忙着给植物换盆和浇水。还给了 Lamplighter 一株植物表达感谢，他辛苦了这么久。那你呢，有什么新鲜事儿吗？", "violation